Actually, pretty simple answer to this one:

If pills become part of Nethack, that means potions
will become rarer.

As pills can't be "alchemized" (only potions), you make
end-game alchemy harder, while still allowing alchemy.
Add a couple more advantages to pills (add the toolbox
"pill case", make pills weigh 1 weight) and you've got
a pretty big choice to make.

